# Personal data - never commit. The resumes stay on this machine only, and
# profile.txt is excluded too: it consolidates the full work history from every
# resume version into one file, which does not belong in a public repository.
# Anyone cloning this regenerates their own with `python match.py build-profile`.
resumes/
profile.txt
*.pdf
*.docx

# Generated
profile.review.md
.jobmatch_usage.jsonl

# Vector store. Fully regenerable from ./job_postings/ with `index-postings`,
# and it embeds your profile's neighbourhood, so it is not worth committing.
chroma_db/

# Environment
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env

# macOS
.DS_Store
